<title>USA: TABLE-Stone Container Corp Q2 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Stone Container Corp Q2 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $1.23     loss	 $0.23</p>
<p> Net	 loss	 120,700     loss	21,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,200,200		1,282,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	99,300		   99,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 net includes one-time, non-cash charge of $13.3 million or $0.13 a share for the company's share of a loss from early extinguishment of debt at Stone-Consolidated in connection with the merger of Stone-Consolidated Corp with Abitibi-Price. Excluding the charge, Q2 1997 loss was $107.4 million or $1.10 a share.  </p>
<p>SIX MONTHS  Shr	 loss	   $2.23   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net	 loss	 217,400   profit	11,300</p>
<p> Revs		   2,381,100		2,603,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  99,300		   99,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding the one-time Q2 charge, first half 1997 loss was $204.1 million, or $2.10 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
